    1 WATER Xyz Monster you control; Special Summon from your Extra Deck, 1 WATER
    Xyz Monster that is 1 Rank higher than that monster you control, by using it
    as material. (This is treated as an Xyz Summon. Transfer its materials to the
    Summoned monster.) You can only use 1 "Xyz Revive Splash" effect per turn, and
    only once that turn.
